Value Filldown VRF (\S+)
Value Filldown NETWORK (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value Filldown PREFIX_LENGTH (\d+)
Value Required PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value DISTANCE (\d+)
Value METRIC (\d+)
Value FLAG ([RDTB]*)
Value NEXTHOP_IP (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value NEXTHOP_IF (\S+)

# One record per next hop (eNSP Pro AR6700, USG6306F and CE6800, YunShan OS 1.25.1.1).
# An equal-cost next hop is a row without the destination. The public table names itself
# "_public_" and leaves VRF empty; a VPN instance's table (the per-VRF command) names it.
Start
  ^\d{4}-\d\d-\d\d \d\d:\d\d:\d\d(?:\.\d+)?\s*$$
  ^Proto: Protocol\s+Pre: Preference\s*$$
  ^Route Flags: .*$$
  ^-+\s*$$
  ^Routing Table\s*:\s*_public_\s*$$
  ^Routing Table\s*:\s*${VRF}\s*$$
  ^\s*Destinations\s*:\s*\d+\s+Routes\s*:\s*\d+\s*$$
  ^Destination/Mask\s+Proto\s+Pre\s+Cost\s+Flags\s+NextHop\s+Interface\s*$$
  ^\s*${NETWORK}/${PREFIX_LENGTH}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${DISTANCE}\s+${METRIC}\s+${FLAG}\s+${NEXTHOP_IP}\s+${NEXTHOP_IF}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${DISTANCE}\s+${METRIC}\s+${FLAG}\s+${NEXTHOP_IP}\s+${NEXTHOP_IF}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error "unrecognized display ip routing-table line"
